            "text": "Imagine walking into a store where an assistant instantly knows your preferences, answers your questions in seconds, and even helps you check out—without waiting in line. Sounds like a dream, right? Well, in the digital world, this is exactly what chatbots and conversational marketing are doing for businesses. These technologies are completely transforming how brands engage with their customers, making interactions faster, smoother, and more personal. Let’s explore the magic behind them!"
