            "text": "A chatbot is like a super-efficient digital assistant that never sleeps. Whether you’re browsing a website, scrolling on social media, or reaching out for customer support, chances are, you’ve interacted with one. These AI-powered helpers can answer questions, provide recommendations, and even process transactions—all in real time."
