            "text": " provide foundational knowledge in various concepts including social media marketing and search engine optimization (SEO) and pay per click advertising (PPC) and content marketing and more. While this theoretical knowledge forms the basis of understanding digital marketing strategies, it is through hands-on learning that students can bridge the gap between theory and practice."
