            "text": "Live projects in digital marketing courses offer students real time exposure to the industry. They provide an opportunity to work on projects that simulate real client requirements and give students a taste of what it is like to work as a digital marketer. This exposure allows students to understand client expectations and industry standards and best practices and helps them gain a competitive edge in the job market."
