            "text": "Practical digital marketing courses often provide specialised training in specific areas such as SEO. SEO training is particularly valuable as it equips students with the knowledge and skills necessary to improve a website’s visibility in search engine results. With a practical understanding of SEO techniques, students can help businesses enhance their online presence and drive organic traffic."
