            "type": "text",
            "text": "Synthesio helps track conversations on very specific topics in carefully segregated audiences. It allows you to categorize your social listening data by language, location, demographics, sentiment, gender, influence, and more. Another positive feature of Synthesio is that the reports also come with a handy social reputation score."
